[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   step_067: Prospective detection power -- how many future detached-TNO
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   discoveries separate the domain-boundary prediction from the
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   footprint-only null?
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   step_054 issued the dated falsifiable predictions: the intrinsic-axis
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   model expects ~59 per cent of future detached discoveries inside the
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   pre-declared 60 deg cap (mean varpi 49 deg), against a footprint-only
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   baseline of ~42 per cent (mean 10.5 deg).  This step turns those rates
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   into a power statement by Monte-Carlo: for each candidate future sample
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   size N, draw realizations of the discovery count under both models and
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   measure how decisively a future observation separates them.
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   Channels
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   C1 cap fraction   : in-cap count ~ Binomial(N, p) with p_wall = 0.59
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   (mixture prediction, step_b13/b19) vs p_fp = 0.42
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   (footprint-convolved baseline).  The discriminator is
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   the one-sided binomial test of the observed count
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   against p_fp; power = fraction of wall realizations
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   rejecting at alpha.
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   C2 mean direction : per-object varpi drawn from the measured mixture
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   (clustered fraction f = 0.43, von Mises
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   sigma = 34.4 deg about 49 deg + footprint remainder)
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   vs the footprint-only distribution centred on
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   10.5 deg.  Discriminator: circular mean resultant
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   length R; power estimated against the footprint
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   null's R distribution.
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   C3 comet channel  : fresh class-1-like comet cohort; in-cap fraction
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   0.352 of the sample (CODE-measured); rate of
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   rotation > 0.2 deg = 0.579 in-cap vs 0.229 out-cap.
[2026-09-21 14:47:55 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 067]   Power of the in/out rate contrast vs cohort size.
